OL,3,GNEWSATrain station parking a daily
OL,4,Abattle, drivers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommuters say a train station car park
OL,7,Fin a growing town is like the "Wild
OL,8,FWest" and in desperate need of
OL,9,Fimprovements.
OL,11,FDuring a visit to Howden Railway
OL,12,FStation, East Yorkshire, the BBC found
OL,13,Fthe car park overflowing by 07:00 BST,
OL,14,Fwith 56 cars squeezed on to a patch of
OL,15,Fland meant to accommodate 21 and others
OL,16,Fleft on grass verges beside the road.
OL,18,FSian Dickinson, who uses the car park
OL,19,Ftwice a week, said: "It's an absolute
OL,20,Ffight and a struggle, just to try and
OL,21,Ffind a space."
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
